            <p id="sidebar-tool-readonly-banner" class="sidebar-tool-status" data-state="readonly" role="note" hidden>开发只读预览 · 未安装。模拟读取仅返回空值；禁止写入、发送消息、控制网页或运行任务。需要正式使用时，请另行审阅并安装工具包。</p>
            <div id="sidebar-tool-frame" class="sidebar-tool-frame"></div>
            <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-launch" class="od-button" hidden>打开工具</button>
            <section id="sidebar-tool-retired-draft" class="sidebar-tool-settings-view od-surface" aria-label="停用前的草稿" hidden>
              <p>工具已停止。以下表单草稿可选择并复制；关闭此窗口后副本会丢失。</p>
              <textarea id="sidebar-tool-retired-draft-text" aria-label="可复制的草稿副本" readonly></textarea>
              <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-retired-draft-dismiss" class="od-button">清除草稿副本</button>
            </section>
            <section id="sidebar-tool-settings-view" class="sidebar-tool-settings-view od-surface" aria-label="工具设置" hidden>
              <div class="sidebar-toc-settings-row"><strong>工具启停</strong><button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-enable" class="od-button od-button--secondary" aria-pressed="true">停用工具</button></div>
              <p id="sidebar-tool-enable-hint" class="sidebar-toc-settings-hint" role="status"></p>
              <div class="sidebar-toc-settings-scope">
                <div><span class="sidebar-toc-settings-caption" id="sidebar-tool-settings-scope-label">当前网站授权</span><strong id="sidebar-tool-settings-target">请选择适用网页</strong></div>
                <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-settings-scope" hidden>只设置本页</button>
              </div>
              <div class="sidebar-toc-settings-binary" role="group" aria-label="当前网站授权">
                <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-settings-allow" aria-pressed="false">授权当前网站</button>
                <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-settings-deny" aria-pressed="false">撤销当前网站授权</button>
              </div>
              <p id="sidebar-tool-settings-hint" class="sidebar-toc-settings-hint" role="status"></p>
              <div id="sidebar-tool-visibility-settings" hidden>
                <strong class="sidebar-toc-settings-title">网页悬浮目录外观</strong>
                <div class="sidebar-toc-settings-row"><span>此网站</span><button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-settings-site-visibility" class="sidebar-toc-visibility-toggle">隐藏</button></div>
                <div class="sidebar-toc-settings-row"><span>仅此页面</span><button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-settings-page-visibility" class="sidebar-toc-visibility-toggle">隐藏</button></div>
                <p class="sidebar-toc-settings-hint">网站可用且工具启用时显示；隐藏只影响网页悬浮目录，Side Panel 目录仍可使用。两级隐藏规则都恢复后才显示。</p>
              </div>
              <details class="sidebar-toc-advanced" open>
                <summary>网站与页面例外</summary>
                <strong class="sidebar-toc-settings-title" id="sidebar-tool-settings-sites-title">已授权的网站</strong>
                <div id="sidebar-tool-settings-sites" class="sidebar-toc-settings-entries"></div>
                <div id="sidebar-tool-page-exceptions" hidden>
                  <strong class="sidebar-toc-settings-title">阅读目录已排除的页面</strong>
                  <div id="sidebar-tool-settings-pages" class="sidebar-toc-settings-entries"></div>
                </div>
              </details>
            </section>
          </section>
          <p id="sidebar-tool-status" class="sidebar-tool-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
          <section id="sidebar-tool-inline-remove" class="sidebar-tool-inline-remove od-surface" aria-label="卸载工具确认" hidden>
            <p id="sidebar-tool-inline-remove-text"></p>
            <div class="sidebar-tool-inline-remove-actions">
              <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-inline-remove-confirm" class="od-button">确认卸载并删除数据</button>
              <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-inline-remove-cancel" class="od-button od-button--secondary">取消</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div id="workbench-cloud" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-cloud" class="od-page" data-workbench-page="cloud" hidden>
        <section class="cloud-panel od-stack" aria-label="云控管理">
          <header class="cloud-panel-head od-toolbar">
            <div class="cloud-panel-heading"><strong>云控</strong><p class="hint">与当前目标网页并排查看云任务及执行状态。</p></div>
            <button type="button" id="cloud-overview-refresh" class="od-icon-button" title="刷新云控状态" aria-label="刷新云控状态"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11a8 8 0 0 0-14-5L4 8m0-5v5h5M4 13a8 8 0 0 0 14 5l2-2m0 5v-5h-5"/></svg></button>
          </header>
          <section class="cloud-overview od-surface" aria-label="云控实时概览">
            <p id="cloud-overview-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在读取云控状态…</p>
            <div class="cloud-overview-metrics">
              <div><span>提供者</span><strong id="cloud-overview-provider">检测中</strong></div>
              <div><span>连接</span><strong id="cloud-overview-connection">检测中</strong></div>
              <div><span>执行宿主</span><strong id="cloud-overview-host">检测中</strong></div>
              <div><span>执行槽</span><strong id="cloud-overview-slot">检测中</strong></div>
              <div><span>已批准任务</span><strong id="cloud-overview-tasks">—</strong></div>
              <div><span>云请求数</span><strong id="cloud-overview-requests">—</strong></div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section class="cloud-requests od-surface" aria-label="云请求状态样本">
            <div class="cloud-section-title od-toolbar"><strong>请求状态</strong><span class="hint">最多 5 条，脱敏显示</span></div>
            <ol id="cloud-request-samples" class="cloud-request-samples"><li>暂无云请求</li></ol>
          </section>
        <details id="cloud-hosting" class="task-scope-panel"><summary>连接与授权 <span id="cloud-brief" class="cloud-status-brief">未配对</span></summary>
            <label>提供者地址 <input id="cloud-url" type="url" placeholder="https://可信提供者地址"></label>
            <label>提供者身份 <input id="cloud-provider-id" autocomplete="off"></label>
            <label>配对码 <input id="cloud-pairing-code" type="password" autocomplete="off"></label>
            <label><input id="cloud-loopback" type="checkbox">明确允许固定本地测试提供者 HTTP/WS</label>
            <p class="hint">云控框架已内置，无需在「工具」中导入。开发回环服务请输入 http://127.0.0.1:43112 并明确允许本地测试；普通服务器应使用 HTTPS。</p>
            <button id="cloud-pair" type="button">配对提供者</button>
            <p>请先在「我的」安装并选择任务。托管授权固定当前安装版本、摘要、授权代次及该任务网站范围。</p>
            <label><input id="cloud-consent" type="checkbox">批准所选固定任务和网站范围，在合法浏览器执行宿主可用时运行</label>
            <label><input id="cloud-result-consent" type="checkbox">允许该固定任务结果回传</label>
            <div><button id="cloud-approve" type="button">批准并启用托管</button><button id="cloud-stop" type="button">停止托管并请求取消</button><button id="cloud-unpair" type="button">解除配对</button><button id="cloud-refresh" type="button">核对状态</button></div>
            <p class="hint">关闭 Side Panel 后不承诺无人值守执行。停止后保留取消处理中、退休待核对和未知结果；正常重连复用已有授权。</p>
            <p id="cloud-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未配对</p>
          </details>
    
          <p class="hint">云控复用「我的」已安装授权的任务和原 RunHost。切换选项卡不会启动第二个执行器；关闭 Side Panel 后不承诺任务继续运行。</p>
        </section>
      </div>
